%N A224292 Number of permutations of length n avoiding 1234 and containing exactly 1 occurrence of 1243.
%C A224292 a(n) is also the number of permutations of length n avoiding 1243 and containing exactly 1 occurrence of 1234.
%H A224292 Brian Nakamura, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1301.5080">Approaches for enumerating permutations with a prescribed number of occurrences of patterns</a>, arXiv:1301.5080 [math.CO], 2013.
%F A224292 Conjecture: D-finite with recurrence 3*(n+2)*(n-4)*a(n) -(17*n^2-58*n+75)*a(n-1) -3*(n^2-8*n+18)*a(n-2) +(n-3)*(n-5)*a(n-3) = 0. - _Pedro Ferreira Pereira_, Nov 08 2026
